      "text": [
        "ه عن أبي الورد فقد رويته عن أبي- رحمه اللّه- عن الحميريّ، عن محمّد بن الحسين بن أبي الخطّاب، عن الحسن بن محبوب، عن عليّ بن رئاب، عن أبي الورد."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Everything in this book that is narrated from Abu Al-Ward has been transmitted by me from my father - may Allah (swt) have mercy on him - from Al-Himyari, from Muhammad ibn Al-Husayn ibn Abi Al-Khattab, from Al-Hasan ibn Mahbub, from Ali ibn Ri'ab, from Abu Al-Ward."
        ]
      }
